  <div className="score-dimensions">{report.dimensions.map(d=><DimensionAccordion key={d.id} dimension={d} open={openId===d.id} onToggle={()=>setOpenId(id=>id===d.id?null:d.id)} onSpatialAction={dispatchSpatial} depthPreview={d.items.some(item=>item.link_target==='winter-depth')?renderDepthPreview?.(`score-linked-mobile-${d.id}`):undefined}/>)}</div><div className="score-method"><strong>{example?'示例口径':'后端方法声明 · 前端未验证'}</strong><p>{report.methodology_note||'后端尚未提供方法声明。'}</p><p>精度、法规适用与S级可达性需独立验证。</p></div></>:<p className="score-provenance">当前模拟接口未提供 score_report。保留原有指标、热力与剖面，不从正午结果推造全天日照或低碳分数。</p>}
- <details className="simulation-disclosure" open={diagnostics} onToggle={e=>setDiagnostics(e.currentTarget.open)}><summary>冬夏工况指标与剖面对照<ChevronDown size={15}/></summary><div>{children}</div></details>
- <div className="score-optimize"><button className="optimize-button" onClick={onOptimize} disabled={!canOptimize||busy}>{busy?'正在优化参数…':example?'优化构件':'优化评分'}</button>{busy&&<button className="text-button" onClick={onCancel}>取消寻优</button>}<p>以实际后端目标为准，不承诺分数提升或S级。演示模式仍是原网格评分，非此独立评分示例。</p></div>
+
+ </section><section id="report-panel-date" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="report-tab-date" className="report-view-panel" hidden={active!=='date'} tabIndex={0}><h3>当前日期 · 前端几何</h3>{preview}</section>
+ <section id="report-panel-cases" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="report-tab-cases" className="report-view-panel" hidden={active!=='cases'} tabIndex={0}><h3>{example?'演示两至工况':'后端两至工况'} <span className="report-update">{pending?'更新中':example?'近似示例':'接口结果'}</span></h3><p className="report-scope">{example?'演示':'接口'}指标与代表射线，不是所选日期或全年性能。</p>{children}</section>
+ <div className="score-optimize"><button className="optimize-button" onClick={onOptimize} disabled={!canOptimize||busy}>{busy?'正在优化参数…':example?'优化构件':'优化评分'}</button>{busy&&<button className="text-button" onClick={onCancel}>取消寻优</button>}<p>{example?'近似网格寻优，不对应此独立评分示例。':'以实际后端冬夏工况目标为准，不承诺提分或S级。'}</p></div>
+
  </div>{previewDimension&&renderDepthPreview&&<div className="linked-section-preview">{renderDepthPreview("score-linked-desktop")}</div>}</section>;
 }
